      {
        "x": 2150,
        "y": 2380,
        "text": "a jump or a glide can't reach the far ledge (it is 320 up): the throw is the way"
      },
      {
        "x": 2250,
        "y": 2920,
        "text": "SLOW LINE: drop through the root hatch (down + jump) into the dark tunnel under the gap; up through the hatch at 3600 (~15 s)"
      },
      {
        "x": 3020,
        "y": 2260,
        "text": "the far ledge: snuff W-throw from here with a jump-cut, and B leaves"
      },
      {
